{
  "stops": [
    {
      "poi_id": "p1",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": "m1",
      "note": "Caves, shrines and a view that makes you forget your legs hurt. Red socks optional, awe guaranteed."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p12",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Follow your nose through the stalls and let the ladies feed you things you can't pronounce. That's the real tour."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p8",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Soft sand, warm water, and a horizon that goes on longer than my afternoon nap. Dip a toe for me."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p27",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Egg coffee thick enough to stand a spoon in, with a dragon view. Sweet fuel for the evening."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p3",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": "m3",
      "note": "The bridges put on their lights and the river does the rest. Best free show in town."
    }
  ]
}
```

```json
{
  "stops": [
    {
      "poi_id": "p1",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": "m1",
      "note": "Climb the stone steps early, the caves stay cool and the views stretch to the sea. Keep your snacks zipped, the macaques have sticky fingers."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p12",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Weave through the stalls and let the smells lead you to something crispy or steaming. A perfect spot to practise your first xin chào (hello) with the vendors."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p27",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Egg coffee whipped thick as cloud, sweet and strong. Sip it slow and watch the river traffic drift by."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p8",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Soft sand, warm water, and a horizon that never sits still. Walk far enough south and the city noise melts into the waves."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p3",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": "m3",
      "note": "The bridges glow and change colour while the river mirrors every light. From up in the trees I can see who still hasn't voted, and from here you can see the whole city breathe."
    }
  ]
}
```

